{"id":"u-c545d7c4-19de-40c0-a41c-d37a18c33fe7","src":"community","title":"Calisthenics Strength Base (Dumbbell Edition)","author":"Mohammed Ali","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/mkWPr0-new-calisthanixx","desc":"This is a dumbbell-only home workout program, designed to build a well-balanced physique with a focus on shoulders, back, traps, chest, and arms, while also strengthening the core muscles (abs and lower back).\nThe course is structured as a 5-day split, ensuring both strength and aesthetics:\n\nPush: Pressing movements (Chest + Triceps + Front Shoulders).\n\nPull: Pulling movements (Back + Biceps + Traps).\n\nLegs: Lower body strength + Core assistance.\n\nShoulders: Focused on shoulder development and traps.\n\nCore + Arms: Isolation work for arms and solid core training.\n\nThis program is suitable for beginners and intermediates who want to increase strength while achieving a defined and proportional body. Each exercise is progressive in reps or weight depending on your development.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Bodyweight Fitness","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":60,"joins":42,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-11-03T18:37:22.714Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1 – Push (صدر + أكتاف أمام","Day 2 – Pull (ظهر + بايسبس + ت","Day 3 – Legs (ساق + كور مساعد)","Day 4 – Shoulders + ترابيس","Day 5 – Core + Arms (بايسبس +"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pec Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"French Press","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Diamond Push Up","sets":[{"amrap":1,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Dumbbell Shrugs","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":